# CQ18 [Sensing & failures] In which format are sensor measurements presented?
PREFIX optimar: <https://w3id.org/optimar#>
PREFIX sosa: <http://www.w3.org/ns/sosa/>
PREFIX qudt: <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
PREFIX owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>
SELECT ?format (GROUP_CONCAT(STRAFTER(STR(?sensor), "#"); separator=", ") AS ?sensors) WHERE {
  ?sensor optimar:dataFormat ?format .
} GROUP BY ?format
